    "detailed_description": "In this colorful twin-stick shooter inspired by 2000's-era Flash games, survive several waves of uniquely deadly enemies with your wits and skill.  Choose wisely from a tree of upgrades after each wave to refine your strategy and bring down your foes.  Live to see what lies at the end of the horde.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2>Choose from two unique classes to take down your foes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/300c26852b678c569c3481ada146965f.poster.avif?t=1699934043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/300c26852b678c569c3481ada146965f.webm?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/300c26852b678c569c3481ada146965f.mp4?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/1a26c489255bb615307618572d3f20ea.poster.avif?t=1699934043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/1a26c489255bb615307618572d3f20ea.webm?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/1a26c489255bb615307618572d3f20ea.mp4?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2>Collect upgrade points after each wave to spend on a plethora of different upgrades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/ea9a9d4c0dd0cad8dd3a5ef5bf7c99c3.poster.avif?t=1699934043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/ea9a9d4c0dd0cad8dd3a5ef5bf7c99c3.webm?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/ea9a9d4c0dd0cad8dd3a5ef5bf7c99c3.mp4?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2>Each wave, the enemies get tougher and more varied.  Adaptability is essential to success.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/4f1eea164e23969e772ea0527a989992.poster.avif?t=1699934043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/4f1eea164e23969e772ea0527a989992.webm?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/4f1eea164e23969e772ea0527a989992.mp4?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Campaigns</h2>Download and play through campaigns made by other players or make your own in the wave editor.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/a121d25f24a3e189bd4ee71a12b3deec.poster.avif?t=1699934043\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/a121d25f24a3e189bd4ee71a12b3deec.webm?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477930/extras/a121d25f24a3e189bd4ee71a12b3deec.mp4?t=1699934043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Attributions:<br>Trailer music - SOUND AIRYLUVS by ISAo",
